    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d287">

                <pb facs="0401" n="401" xml:id="pg401"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Seward to Mr.
                            Haldeman</hi>.</head>
                <note rend="inline" type="source">[Extract.]</note>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 7.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of
                            State</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1861-09-07"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 7, 1861</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * </p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * </p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * </p>
                <p>Your communications concerning internal questions in Sweden are appreciated, and
                    we hope that the succession to the throne may be settled in a manner
                    satisfactory to the government, and conducive to the welfare of the enlightened
                    people whom it so deeply concerns.</p>
                <p>We have already forgotten the reverse of our arms at Bull Run, which affected you
                    so deeply, and the prospect of the restoration of the authority of the Union is
                    entirely satisfactory. Our volunteer army will, I have no doubt, vindicate its
                    character and win back the confidence of the country and its friends.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jacob S. Haldeman</hi>, Esq.,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c., Stockholm</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
